OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman, 80, set
OL,4,Aon fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force confirmed the man, 33, from
OL,7,FWatford, had been arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof conspiracy to commit arson with
OL,9,Fintent to endanger life. He remains in
OL,10,Fpolice custody.
